<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντελέχ-εια</span></b> , ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντελής, ἔχειν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full, complete reality,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις, ψυχή ἐστιν ἐ. ἡ πρώτη
					σώματος φυσικοῦ δυνάμει ζωὴν ἔχοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					412a27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ ἐντελεχεία ὄντος τὸ δυνάμει
					ὂν γίνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>GA</u>
					734a30
				</span></i>
			; distd. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέργεια,</span>
			<i>actuality,</i> opp. <i>activity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1050a23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				257b8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.625
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδ-</span> codd.), <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.7.8
			</span></i>; later, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ᾠὸν κατὰ δύναμιν μέν ἐστι
					νεοσσός, κατ᾽ ἐντελέχειαν δὲ οὐκ ἔοτιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					10.340
				</span></i>
			, cf. Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.37
			</span></i> H.: confused with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδέλεχεια</span> (q.v.) by <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Tusc.</u>
				1.10.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Jud. Voc.</u>
				10
			</span></i>.</div>
